sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sensor as RGB-D Sensor
    participant Agent as Capture Agent
    participant Enc as scc_encoder
    participant Disp as DisparityBuilder
    participant Mov as MovementDetector
    participant Quad as QuadTreeMap
    participant rANS as rANS Engines
    participant Mux as SEI Muxer
    participant H264 as H.264 Encoder
    participant Net as SFU / File Sink

    Sensor->>Agent: RGB frame + Depth frame (W×H, 16bpp)
    Agent->>Enc: encode_frame(rgb, depth, profile)
    Enc->>Enc: filter (median / hole-fill)
    Enc->>Enc: bit-depth adapt → 12 bpp
    Enc->>Disp: build S = row-prefix differences
    Disp-->>Enc: disparity matrix S
    Enc->>Mov: diff vs previous frame
    Mov->>Quad: build quad-tree of motion regions
    Quad-->>Enc: region map + per-region pattern
    Enc->>Enc: split S → TOP / R / B
    Enc->>rANS: encode TOP (8-bit)
    Enc->>rANS: encode B (8-bit)
    Enc->>rANS: encode R (16-bit)
    rANS-->>Enc: packed payloads
    Enc->>Mux: pack header + payloads
    Mux-->>H264: SEI user_data_unregistered (UUID + payload)
    Agent->>H264: RGB frame
    H264->>H264: encode RGB to NAL units
    H264->>Net: NAL stream (RGB + SEI interleaved)
